  Command mode & context        │                                                                  ┃
                                │   1. Choose a pack and highlight a problem.                      ┃
                                │   2. Press v to read it without creating files, or Enter to      ┃
                                │   create a missing solution template and copy its path.          ┃
                                │   3. Press e to edit, t to test examples, and s to judge and     ┃
                                │   record a submission.                                           ┃
                                │   4. Inspect Cases and Output with Tab. Use h for submission     ┃
                                │   history.                                                       ┃
                                │                                                                  ┃
                                │   ## Find your way                                               ┃
                                │                                                                  ┃
                                │   Esc goes back. :list returns to the problem list. :pack list   ┃
                                │   opens the pack picker. :q exits the TUI.                       ┃
                                │                                                                  │
                                │   ? shows the current page's shortcut reference. This guide      │
                                │   explains the workflow. Use Tab / Shift+Tab to change topics,   │
                                │   j/k or Up/Down to scroll, Ctrl+d/u to scroll half a page,      │
